{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Can't Sleep?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To discuss how to deal with problems such as health issues, you can use modals like <span class =\"italic\">might</span>, <span class =\"italic\">could</span>, or <span class =\"italic\">should</span>. <br/><br/>These are very polite structures. <br/><br/>The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with <span class =\"italic\">\u201cIf ... \u201d</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you can't sleep, you might want to look at your diet."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You could try keeping a regular eating schedule during the day and having a light snack at night. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should avoid drinking too many caffeinated drinks."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the first conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the first conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class =\"italic\">Result</span> clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When the <span class =\"italic\">(if)</span> clause goes before the result clause, you separate the clauses with a comma."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The result clause can also go before the <span class =\"italic\">(if)</span> clause. In this case, you do not use a comma."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you can't sleep, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you might want to look at your diet.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you can't sleep. In this condition: you might want to look at your diet.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you eat a big meal an hour before going to bed, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you probably won't sleep well.  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you will eat a big meal. In this condition: you probably won't sleep well.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The chances of not sleeping are even greater \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"if your meal is more spicy or fatty than usual.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible your meal is more spicy or fatty than usual. In this condition: the chances of not sleeping are even greater.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you can't sleep, you might want to look at your diet."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you eat a big meal an hour before going to bed, you probably won't sleep well."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The chances of not sleeping are even greater if your meal is more spicy or fatty than usual."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be connected"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be associated with; to change according to something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Research has shown that what and when people eat can be connected to how well they sleep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about food and sleep."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what you eat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you can't sleep, experts suggest that you look at your diet. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spicy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "hot to taste; with lots of spice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If your meal is spicy, the chances of not sleeping are even greater.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fatty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "containing a lot of fat (in food)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Eating fatty food may make sleeping more difficult."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the time when something is supposed to happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could try keeping a regular eating schedule during the day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "caffeinated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "containing caffeine, like coffee, tea or soda"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should avoid drinking too many caffeinated drinks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alcohol"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Fermented drinks such as beer, wine, vodka, etc."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Alcohol and caffeine can also affect your sleep. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beverage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should avoid drinking too many caffeinated beverages."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob01aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le02ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, make a list of things that negatively (in a bad way) affect your ability to sleep."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of things that improve your ability to sleep."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online to add new ideas to your lists."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give each other suggestions about how to improve sleep. You can talk about anything connected to diet or lifestyle. Try to use conditional sentences (<span class=\"italic\">If...</span>)."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about health by discussing things that affect sleep."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I research other ideas to improve sleep."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give suggestions using conditional sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to suggestions."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about staying healthy."